{"id":"mcpp","name":"MCPP","form":"capsule","status":"Well-documented","aliases":"","category":"Stimulant","chemicalClass":"Substituted piperazines","psychoactiveClass":"Stimulants","summarySources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","summary":"A phenylpiperazine stimulant first developed in the 1970s before being sold in the RC market. The drug is often mislabelled as MDMA. It is reported to have unpleasant effects such as anxiogenesis and headaches.","doseMaxTick":300,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[{"roa":"Oral","source":"PsychonautWiki","unit":"mg","threshold":"15 mg","light":"20–50 mg","common":"50–120 mg","strong":"120–150 mg","heavy":"150 mg+","commonEstimate":85,"band":{"low":50,"high":120},"domain":[12,264],"segments":{"light":[20,50],"common":[50,120],"strong":[120,150],"heavy":[150,253.44]}}],"durationSources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"Oral","onset":"20–60 min","comeup":"20–60 min","peak":"2–4 h","offset":"3–8 h","afterEffects":"—","total":"—"}],"subjectiveEffects":[],"combinations":[{"substance":"25x-nboh","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"25x-nbome","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"5-htp","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cocaine","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Dxm","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"MAOIs","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"MDMA","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Serotonin releasers","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Snris","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"SSRIs","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Stimulants","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Tramadol","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Alcohol","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Dissociatives","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"MXE","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."}],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/MCPP"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/mcpp"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on MCPP","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q286112"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E9%97%B4%E6%B0%AF%E8%8B%AF%E5%9F%BA%E5%93%8C%E5%97%AA"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/%E9%97%B4%E6%B0%AF%E8%8B%AF%E5%9F%BA%E5%93%8C%E5%97%AA"}],"wikidata":"Q286112","formula":"C10H13ClN2","molarMass":196.67,"pharmacology":{"text":"It has potent anorectic effects and has encouraged the development of selective 5-HT2C receptor agonists for the treatment of obesity as well.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine","kind":"Non-selective serotonin receptor agonist; Serotonin 5-HT2C receptor agonist; Serotonin releasing agent","body":[{"what":"halfLife","says":"4–14 hours"},{"what":"brokenDown","says":"Liver (CYP2D6)"},{"what":"leaves","says":"Urine"}],"figures":"Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine"},"uses":{"text":"It was initially developed in the late-1970s and used in scientific research before being sold as a designer drug in the mid-2000s. It has been detected in pills touted as legal alternatives to illicit stimulants in New Zealand and pills sold as \"ecstasy\" in Europe and the United States.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine","routes":"Oral, intranasal, rectal","figures":"Meta-Chlorophenylpiperazine"},"summaryZh":"間氯苯基哌嗪（英語縮寫mCPP）是一種苯基哌嗪類精神活性藥物。它最初於1970年代末開發並用於科學研究，然後在2000年代中期作為設計師藥物出售。該藥物被發現存在於多種物質里，包括在紐西蘭被吹捧為非法興奮劑的合法替代品藥丸以及在歐洲和美國作為「搖頭丸」出售的藥丸。","summaryZhHans":"间氯苯基哌嗪（英语缩写mCPP）是一种苯基哌嗪类精神活性药物。它最初于1970年代末开发并用于科学研究，然后在2000年代中期作为设计师药物出售。该药物被发现存在于多种物质里，包括在新西兰被吹捧为非法兴奋剂的合法替代品药丸以及在欧洲和美国作为“摇头丸”出售的药丸。"}